## Strategy configuration

`rotation_strategy` and `retention_strategy` are Dynamic objects. The nested `type` is the
**strategy config** type (e.g. `TimeBasedRotationStrategyConfig`), while
`rotation_strategy_class` / `retention_strategy_class` are the strategy class names
(e.g. `TimeBasedRotationStrategy`).

Discover live schemas with:

```terraform
data "graylog_index_set_strategy_types" "available" {}
```

| Rotation class | Config `type` | Typical keys |
|---|---|---|
| `TimeBasedRotationStrategy` | `TimeBasedRotationStrategyConfig` | `rotation_period`, `rotate_empty_index_set` |
| `MessageCountRotationStrategy` | `MessageCountRotationStrategyConfig` | `max_docs_per_index` |
| `SizeBasedRotationStrategy` | `SizeBasedRotationStrategyConfig` | `max_size` |
| `TimeBasedSizeOptimizingStrategy` | `TimeBasedSizeOptimizingStrategyConfig` | size-optimizing period keys |

| Retention class | Config `type` | Typical keys |
|---|---|---|
| `DeletionRetentionStrategy` | `DeletionRetentionStrategyConfig` | `max_number_of_indices` |
| `NoopRetentionStrategy` | `NoopRetentionStrategyConfig` | `max_number_of_indices` |

